  m_Name: help_fire
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Antarium.Content::Antarium.Content.HelpTopicDef
  id: help_fire
  displayName: Fire
  order: 450
  category: World
  icon: item_coal
  body: 'Coal, roots, mycelium and giant fungus burn. Lava flowing next to them, or a meteorite, can set them alight. Fire spreads to whatever burns next to it, gives off smoke and burns ants close by; burnt cells turn to ash, which falls like sand.


    Water next to a fire puts it out at once, and digging a burning cell out ends it. A Fire card shows how much is burning.'
  reveal: 1
